{
  "_what": "Studio themes: token overrides over app/styles/tokens.css. A studio's registry entry names one (studios/<slug>.json \"theme\"). scripts/studio.mjs folds it into the studio's STUDIO_THEME var; worker/routes/studio.ts serves it as /studio-theme.css. The token NAMES are the app's palette slots (named for their first use, not their colour): --gold is the accent, --espresso the dark surface, --cream the page ground, --rose the focus and flourish colour.",
